# Board XNU patches, applied after the arch, SoC and OS series.
# One patch per line, relative to this directory; '#' starts a comment.
#
# The early-boot console hooks. package/drivers/BootProgress/BootProgress.c
# includes <kern/early_boot_progress.h>, and that header -- with its
# osfmk/kern/Makefile export entry and the start.s / arm_init.c / sleh.c call
# sites -- exists nowhere else: the shared series carry boot_progress.h
# (os:zzz-boot-progress.patch) but not the early-boot half, and the engine at
# upstream.rev 6790e7c has no zzzz-early-boot-progress.patch of its own.
# Without this line the header is never generated, <tree>/osfmk/kern holds no
# early_boot_progress.h, and scripts/build-boot-progress.py stops the kernel
# step on "'kern/early_boot_progress.h' file not found".
zzzz-early-boot-progress.patch
